Package: keenetic-smb-ui
Version: __VERSION__
Depends: libc, samba4-server, samba4-client, blkid
Source: https://github.com/FlyMater/keenetic-smb-ui-tm
SourceName: keenetic-smb-ui
License: AGPL-3.0-or-later
Section: net
URL: https://github.com/FlyMater/keenetic-smb-ui-tm
Maintainer: FlyMater <https://github.com/FlyMater>
Architecture: __ARCH__
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Description: SMB server manager with a web UI for Keenetic/Entware routers.
 Runs a private Samba instance bound to a dedicated IP, aggregates external
 SMB shares and local disks, and configures a separate Time Machine
 destination through a built-in web panel.
 Based on keenetic-smb-ui by tommilevs (https://github.com/tommilevs/keenetic-smb-ui).
